**Technical Brief: Low Poly Fantasy Dragon (15cm FDM Print)**

A **single-piece low-poly fantasy dragon (150mm height, ~500 triangles)** featuring geometric angular wings, blocky limbs, tapered tail, and simplified head with minimal overhangs (<45°) for support-free FDM printing on PLA at 0.2mm layers. **Print orientation: standing upright on flat base (150x80mm footprint); wall thickness 1.2-1.5mm minimum; estimated 5-6 hour print, 40-50g material, zero supports required.** **Key design: angular faceted body, splayed legs for stability, swept-back wings angled <45°, tail curves upward to avoid bed collision.**

---

